programs and accounts issued by any third-party bank or program manager. In addition, it offers tax processing services consisting of tax refund transfers, which provide the processing technology to facilitate receipt of a taxpayers' refund proceeds; small business lending to independent tax preparation providers that seek small advances; and fast cash advance, a loan that enables tax refund recipients. Green Dot Corporation was incorporated in 1999 and is headquartered in Provo, Utah.","ceo_bio":"Mr. William I. Jacobs J.D. | CEO & Chairman of the Board | Age 83 | Compensation: $3.0M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 900 people. Revenue per employee of $2.3M ranks in the top quartile among Financial Services peers, with revenue growing 11%/yr across its filed history. Each employee generates $73K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $21K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["Green Dot Corporation is a small-cap financial services business with a $659M market cap on $2.1B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +13% over the past three years and +12% annually across the full decade, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 67% against a 10% cost of capital \u2014 a 58-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $66M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 3 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 1.1\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 0.0%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 4.1% of the shares, and profit capture is only 0.0\u00d7 the fair share, suggesting no structural edge inside its industry."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.1) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Operating margins 28% below sector median \u2014 a cost disadvantage the moat cannot hide","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Fragmented industry with below-average profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Financial quality metrics lag Financial Services peers","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 72% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Financial Services peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Among the least levered in Financial Services \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Trad